ant to be part of it with us, we always have room for more folks, in Folklands! </p>","developers":["Bromantic Games"],"dlc":[3596590],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2282890/e84610b0f93c64518f78e15a0e5be2ded279c948/header.jpg?t=1770716308","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Ubuntu 22.04+ or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dualcore 64 bit Intel\u00ae or AMD AMD\u00ae from 2015 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.1 And Direct 12 or higher Compatible graphics card with 4GB VRAM or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11 (Big Sur) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 (ARM64) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980 | AMD RX 590, with 4GB VRAM or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2282890/635961/1cf01ddac08d97050ce9196a686e3df67add469c/1750981534/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740775183","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2282890/635961/1cf01ddac08d97050ce9196a686e3df67add469c/1750981534/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740775183","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2282890/635961/1cf01ddac08d97050ce9196a68